Z||000000||Eric||05-01-2001||12:55 AM||||I was running up behind a red 2M4 on the highway yesterday, and I felt like having a little fun.  I backed off, letting him get in front of me a ways.  He turned off onto the same highway on-ramp I was planning on turning, so I flogged it, getting right on his asss at the limit of traction.  I let off mid corner before getting back on it and slingshotting myself around him and into the far lefthand lane.  I blapped the horn twice and waved.  The look on his face was too much.  <P>I guess the moral of the story is, don't wave or play around with fellow Fiero owners because they don't get it.  There's nothing worse than seeing a Fiero that's being driven by someone without any pride for it.||||reg||1
Z||000001||beer_stud_21||05-01-2001||03:31 AM||||Or the moral could be:  If you drive like a crazy bastard you will scare the living sh!t out of just about everybody!<P>depends on how you look at it i guess.<P>-Marlin||||reg||4
