Z||000003||LZeitgeist||05-01-2001||06:57 AM||||I doubt he was as impressed with your speed and agility as you were... I imagine he thought you were a jerk. I know I would have if I'd been sitting in his car. <P>Don't involve other people in your "high performance driving". If you'd screwed up - or, if *he'd* done something unexpected, having no knowledge whatsoever of what your intentions were - you'd have killed both of you - or worse yet, just him. Then you'd have had the fun time explaining what you'd been doing to the police and his widow. Woooo... fun stuff.<P>Don't take somebody down with you for a cheap thrill. <BR>||||reg||1
