Z||000006||Ken Wittlief||05-01-2001||08:35 AM||||One of the general 'rules' for driving a sports car is: if you want to have fun and drive fast, corner like a maniac, then go out of your way to make sure you dont interfere with anyone else on the road.<P>   As long as you dont bother anyone your chances of someone calling 911 on the cell phone to report "an idiot on highway 95 driving like he's trying to kill someone" are much lower.<P>  But if people have to speedup cause you are riding their bumper, or slow down cause you pulled out in front of them, or if you scare the bejesus out of someone... there are a lot of cell phones out there now. Some people LOVE to be the lone ranger and report you.||||reg||1
